                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jackson to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Belgrade</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-09-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 21,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Jackson reports that the coronation of the King of Servia took place this
                    day.)</p>
